# CURSOR & AI AGENT CONTEXT RULES

# Always read context before editing code
- Before touching any app or package, inspect the local `CONTEXT.md` in that directory as well as global files in `docs/context/`.
- Maintain strict database table ownership as documented in `docs/context/DATABASE_SCHEMA_MATRIX.md`.
- Enforce contract standards as documented in `docs/context/CONTRACTS_AND_EVENTS.md`.

# Auto-update context documentation
- Automatically update `CONTEXT.md` files upon modifying schemas, routes, contracts, or infrastructure logic.

# Code Style Guidelines
- Pure TypeScript, zero `any`.
- Relative imports must use `.js` extension (e.g. `import { foo } from './foo.js'`).
- Use Turborepo commands: `pnpm turbo run build`, `pnpm turbo run typecheck`, `pnpm turbo run lint`.
- Package namespace: `@platform/<package-name>`.
